{"id":"3cfb4fadc9a1","path":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/what-is-digital-fashion-communication","lang":"en","title":"What is Digital Fashion Communication?","description":"Digital fashion communication is the intersection of fashion and information & communication technologies (ICTs). It's communication of the future... for fashion.","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Master","MDFC","Master in Digital Fashion Communication"],"image":null,"words":146,"alternates":{"en":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/what-is-digital-fashion-communication"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"MDFC","path":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"Master in Digital Fashion Communication","path":null},{"label":"What is Digital Fashion Communication?","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Digital fashion communication is <strong>the intersection of <em>fashion</em> and <em>information &amp; communication technologies</em> (ICTs)</strong>. It is the aspect of communication sciences that studies how fashion is communicated in the digital or online environment, in connection with the traditional – and still highly relevant – offline media channels.</p> <p>Industry professionals, media players and consumers use digital communication and marketing on a daily basis. As a result, consumer’s tastes (what they consider <em>IN</em> or <em>OUT</em>) and people's <em>customs</em> are increasingly being influenced by company-driven and user-generated online contents.</p> <p><strong>Want a more concrete definition?</strong> Everything or anything that has to do with websites, mobile apps, digital marketing, e-Commerce, SEO, usability, web analytics, augmented and virtual reality, social media, artificial intelligence, digital product passports, use of digital tools in the physical shops... in the fashion domain.</p> <p>We’re talking here about <strong>the communication of the future</strong>... for fashion.</p>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"}],"nav":[{"label":"Overview","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"Partners","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/partners"},{"label":"Key facts","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/key-facts"},{"label":"Why this Master","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/why-this-master"},{"label":"Digital Fashion Communication","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/what-is-digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"What is a Double Degree?","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/double-degree"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/structure-and-contents/experiential-learning"},{"label":"Employability","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects"},{"label":"Job Profiles","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/job-profiles"},{"label":"Employers","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/employers"},{"label":"Career Stories","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/career-prospects/career-stories"},{"label":"Career Mentoring","href":"/en/university/info/career/events/career-mentoring/digital-fashion-communication"},{"label":"Application and admission","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/admission/academic-requirements"},{"label":"Fees and Grants","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/fees-and-grants"},{"label":"Practical information","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/organising-your-studies"},{"label":"Open days and study advisory","href":"/en/education/master/digital-fashion-communication/open-days-study-advisory"},{"label":"Contact us","href":